msgid "Choosing a language downloads its speech model once, from the model's publisher, and checks it against a fingerprint. Recognition then runs on this computer: nothing you say is sent."
msgstr "Kuchagua lugha hupakua modeli yake ya sauti mara moja kutoka kwa mchapishaji wake na kuihakiki kwa alama ya kidijitali. Kisha utambuzi hufanya kazi kwenye kompyuta hii: hakuna unachosema kinachotumwa."

